SUMMARY:MusikLab
DESCRIPTION:What is a MusikLab? \nWe provide the space and instruments and you do whatever moves you. MusikLabs are unstructured\, all ages (we recommend 6 months – 9 years)\, and all abilities. Occurs at 9:50am\, 10:40am and 5:20pm. \nVisit our website for details. Registration is required for each participant 17 years and under. Up to 2 grownups are welcome per registered participant. Please pre-register as spots are limited\, we recommend registering 24 hours or more in advance. \nEditor’s note: This event is a community submission.
